{"version":1,"content":"<html><body>\n<h2>DONKI驚現「Sanrio蟹蟹兵團」</h2>\n<p>最近行DONKI驚現一班「蟹蟹」！Sanrio人氣角色Hello Kitty、My Melody、Kuromi、Cinnamoroll及Hangyodon，今次搖身一變成為鮮紅色小蟹，戴著立體蟹鉗頭套、長著可愛蟹腳，萌度爆表！\n</p>\n<h2>戴上立體蟹鉗頭套超可愛!</h2>\n<p>這批「蟹蟹」造型細節十足，頭戴立體蟹鉗頭套，與海鮮冷凍櫃的氣氛完美融合，彷彿真的化身為海鮮市場的小蟹，畫面有趣又治癒。除了角色造型，現場更配以竹籃及「毎日新鮮」小旗作陪襯，濃濃的日本市場風格，令整個場景更具臨場感。</p>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179560081764777980_6454178456b06b1b208b6c.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"0\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"478\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179560081764777980_6454178456b06b1b208b6c.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>(圖片來源：官方圖片)</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/17956008198363633_13244426866b06b1b42eb71.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"0\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"478\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/17956008198363633_13244426866b06b1b42eb71.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>(圖片來源：官方圖片)</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179560082152124023_13612156126b06b1b5dcb30.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"0\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"478\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179560082152124023_13612156126b06b1b5dcb30.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>(圖片來源：官方圖片)</figcaption></figure>\n<blockquote><p>在 Instagram 查看這則貼文<a href=\"https://www.instagram.com/p/DgKDUiwiSwT/?utm_source=ig_embed&amp;utm_campaign=loading\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">新假期 Weekend Weekly（@weekendweekly）分享的貼文</a></p></blockquote>\n<p>\n</p>\n</body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-25T10:23:54.633273+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":349,"images":3,"source":"WeekendHK","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},